Third-party components
----------------------

These components keep their own licences. This notice does not cover them.

- htmx 2.0.4, vendored as src/snorty/dashboard/static/htmx.min.js: Zero-Clause BSD
  (0BSD), https://github.com/bigskysoftware/htmx
- Python packages installed as dependencies (see pyproject.toml and uv.lock): each
  package's own licence.
- Programs that Snorty drives but does not include: Suricata, Snort, Npcap, Wireshark
  (tshark, dumpcap), Sysmon and Ollama. Each one is installed separately by the user
  under its own licence.
- Data that Snorty downloads at run time: DB-IP Lite (CC BY 4.0), Spamhaus DROP,
  abuse.ch Feodo Tracker, the CIRCL OSINT feed (TLP:CLEAR), the CERT Polska warning
  list and Emerging Threats Open rules, each under its provider's terms.
- The ClamAV signature database, which the user downloads with ClamAV's own freshclam;
  Snorty only reads its file hashes, under the ClamAV project's terms.
